            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Turbō in pavīmentō celeriter vertitur. The top spins fast on the floor."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine, third declension. Anything that spins: a top, a whirlwind. English turbine."
            }
